-- My Scores — draft programmes from official university sources (P4-CAR #55;
-- owner decision CAREER-PROGRAMMES, 2026-10-27).
--
-- Bachelor programmes read on 2026-10-27 from:
--   National University of Laos: the bachelor programmes list on nuol.edu.la
--     (77 programmes; continuing-bachelor rows and duplicate spellings left out;
--     entrance groups are not given there, so none is set)
--   Souphanouvong University: notice 488/ມສ of 14 September 2026, majors with
--     places left for 2026-2027 by entrance group (A: STEM, B: non-STEM)
--     (29 programmes)
